"Protocol slot exists ($1 \\rightarrow 6$); firmware converts it to "
"internal index $0 \\rightarrow 5$."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:56
msgid "The selected kinematics is advertised by ``CapabilityRegistry``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:57
msgid ""
"Differential mode requires exactly one ``LEFT_MOTOR`` and one "
"``RIGHT_MOTOR`` role."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:58
msgid "Mecanum mode requires the four front/rear left/right roles exactly once."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:59
msgid "Unused physical slots may remain ``UNBOUND``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:60
msgid "The selected driver, inversion flags and PWM limit are valid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:61
msgid "Configuration version and CRC are valid before EEPROM load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:63
msgid ""
"Motion profiles are currently ``0 = DIRECT`` and ``1 = "
"LIMITED_ACCELERATION``. The latter limits per-update wheel speed changes "
"before PWM scaling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/configuration.rst:66
msgid ""
"The Mega2560 firmware currently advertises Differential and Mecanum "
"kinematics with the TA6586/PCA9685 driver. New hardware or kinematics "
"must be implemented and registered in firmware before the HMI can select "
"them."
msgstr ""

